      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can ICE in the other loop, it just will end up having a bunch of empty cases for things we may not care about, like core builtin calls. It may not be as bad as I thought previously, less things that would actually be empty. I\u0027ll add it in and see.\n\nI thought I had a test case for `let` but that one the let comes before the atomic operation. I\u0027ll add one where it comes after.\n\nEven moving some of the logic into the other method, you\u0027ll still have some here as I don\u0027t think we\u0027d want to move the FunctionParam logic down there as we\u0027d have to find them again. So either way it\u0027s going to end up being split.",
